{"title":"Career Roadmap · Legal Tech Consultant","role":"Legal Tech Consultant","summary":"A Legal Tech Consultant works at the intersection of law, technology, legal operations, compliance, and digital transformation.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Technology Law / AI Governance"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Legal Tech Consultant works at the intersection of law, technology, legal operations, compliance, and digital transformation."},{"type":"p","text":"The role helps law firms, corporate legal departments, startups, government organizations, and professional-services firms use technology to improve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract management"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Document review"},{"text":"Litigation workflows"},{"text":"Compliance monitoring"},{"text":"Legal operations"},{"text":"Knowledge management"},{"text":"E-discovery"},{"text":"AI-assisted legal work"},{"text":"Data privacy and governance"},{"text":"Legal workflow automation"},{"text":"AI governance and responsible AI"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A law graduate entering this field should not position themselves simply as a \"lawyer who knows software.\" The strongest profile combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Law","Legal Operations","Technology","AI Governance","Process Design","Data","Automation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A Legal Tech Consultant may advise an organization on selecting, implementing, configuring, governing, and improving legal technology rather than practicing law independently."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","Integrated Law Degree"]},{"type":"flow","items":["BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB","Technology Law + AI Governance","Legal Research + Legal Operations + Technology Skills","Legal-Tech Projects","Internships","Legal Tech